# LF everywhere. Shell scripts and the instance boot script (infra/user_data.sh.tftpl)
# break with Windows line endings: a CRLF boot script would leave the server
# unable to start or mount the data volume.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.deb binary
# Except the Gradle wrapper for Windows (android/gradlew.bat), which cmd.exe misreads without them.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.jar binary
